  "description": "A physical FM link simulator for measuring soundcard modems: audio is really frequency-modulated onto a carrier, noise is added there at a stated carrier-to-noise ratio, and a limiter and discriminator bring it back through the radio's real audio paths. The threshold effect, triangular discriminator noise, pre/de-emphasis and band limits all emerge rather than being asserted.",
